msgstr "Portnummer för proxy"

#: include/global_settings.php:2352
msgid "TCP port for encrypted communication."
msgstr "TCP-port för krypterad kommunikation."

#: include/global_settings.php:2359 include/global_settings.php:2391
#: utilities.php:275
msgid "RSA Fingerprint"
msgstr "RSA fingeravtryck"

#: include/global_settings.php:2360
msgid "The fingerprint of the current public RSA key the proxy is using. This is required to establish a trusted connection."
msgstr "Fingeravtrycket för den aktuella offentliga RSA-nyckeln som proxyn använder. Detta krävs för att upprätta en betrodd anslutning."

#: include/global_settings.php:2367
msgid "RRDtool Proxy Server - Backup"
msgstr "RRDtool Proxy Server - Säkerhetskopiering"

#: include/global_settings.php:2372
msgid "Load Balancing"
msgstr "Lastbalansering"

#: include/global_settings.php:2373
msgid "If both main and backup proxy are receivable this option allows to spread all requests against RRDtool."
msgstr "Om både huvud- och reservproxy kan tas emot gör detta alternativ det möjligt att sprida alla förfrågningar mot RRDtool."

#: include/global_settings.php:2378
msgid "The DNS hostname or IP address of the RRDtool backup proxy server if proxy is running in MSR mode."
msgstr "DNS-värdnamnet eller IP-adressen för RRDtool backup-proxyservern om proxy körs i MSR-läge."

#: include/global_settings.php:2384
msgid "TCP port for encrypted communication with the backup proxy."
msgstr "TCP-port för krypterad kommunikation med backup-proxyn."

#: include/global_settings.php:2392
msgid "The fingerprint of the current public RSA key the backup proxy is using. This required to establish a trusted connection."
msgstr "Fingeravtrycket för den aktuella offentliga RSA-nyckeln som backup-proxyn använder. Detta krävs för att upprätta en betrodd anslutning."

#: include/global_settings.php:2401
msgid "Spike Kill Settings"
msgstr "Spike Kill-inställningar"

#: include/global_settings.php:2406
msgid "Removal Method"
msgstr "Metod för borttagning"

#: include/global_settings.php:2407
msgid "There are two removal methods.  The first, Standard Deviation, will remove any sample that is X number of standard deviations away from the average of samples.  The second method, Variance, will remove any sample that is X% more than the Variance average.  The Variance method takes into account a certain number of 'outliers'.  Those are exceptional samples, like the spike, that need to be excluded from the Variance Average calculation."
msgstr "Det finns två borttagningsmetoder.  Den första, Standardavvikelse, tar bort alla prover som ligger X antal standardavvikelser från genomsnittet av proverna.  Den andra metoden, Varians, tar bort alla stickprov som är X% mer än Varians-genomsnittet.  Variansmetoden tar hänsyn till ett visst antal \"outliers\".  Det är exceptionella prover, som spiken, som måste uteslutas från beräkningen av variansgenomsnittet."

#: include/global_settings.php:2411
msgid "Standard Deviation"
msgstr "Standardavvikelse"

#: include/global_settings.php:2412
msgid "Variance Based w/Outliers Removed"
msgstr "Variansbaserad med borttagna extremvärden"

#: include/global_settings.php:2416 lib/html.php:2367
msgid "Replacement Method"
msgstr "Ersättningsmetod"

#: include/global_settings.php:2417
msgid "There are three replacement methods.  The first method replaces the spike with the average of the data source in question.  The second method replaces the spike with a 'NaN'.  The last replaces the spike with the last known good value found."
msgstr "Det finns tre ersättningsmetoder.  Den första metoden ersätter spiken med genomsnittet för datakällan i fråga.  Den andra metoden ersätter spiken med ett \"NaN\".  Den sista metoden ersätter spiken med det senast kända goda värde som hittats."

#: include/global_settings.php:2421 lib/html.php:2363
msgid "Average"
msgstr "Genomsnitt"

#: include/global_settings.php:2422 lib/html.php:2364
msgid "NaN's"
msgstr "NaN:s"

#: include/global_settings.php:2423 lib/html.php:2365
msgid "Last Known Good"
msgstr "Senast kända vara"

#: include/global_settings.php:2427
msgid "Number of Standard Deviations"
msgstr "Antal standardavvikelser"

#: include/global_settings.php:2428
msgid "Any value that is this many standard deviations above the average will be excluded.  A good number will be dependent on the type of data to be operated on.  We recommend a number no lower than 5 Standard Deviations."
msgstr "Alla värden som ligger så här många standardavvikelser över genomsnittet kommer att uteslutas.  Vilket antal som är lämpligt beror på vilken typ av data som ska bearbetas.  Vi rekommenderar ett antal som inte är lägre än 5 standardavvikelser."

#: include/global_settings.php:2432 include/global_settings.php:2433
#: include/global_settings.php:2434 include/global_settings.php:2435
#: include/global_settings.php:2436 include/global_settings.php:2437
#: include/global_settings.php:2438 include/global_settings.php:2439
#: include/global_settings.php:2440 include/global_settings.php:2441
#: include/global_settings.php:2442 include/global_settings.php:2443
#: include/global_settings.php:2444
#, php-format
msgid "%d Standard Deviations"
msgstr "%d Standardavvikelser"

#: include/global_settings.php:2448
msgid "Variance Percentage"
msgstr "Avvikelse Procent"

#: include/global_settings.php:2449
#, php-format
msgid "This value represents the percentage above the adjusted sample average once outliers have been removed from the sample.  For example, a Variance Percentage of 100%% on an adjusted average of 50 would remove any sample above the quantity of 100 from the graph."
msgstr "Detta värde representerar procentandelen över det justerade genomsnittet för urvalet när avvikande värden har tagits bort från urvalet.  Till exempel skulle en variansprocent på 100%% på ett justerat genomsnitt på 50 ta bort alla stickprov över kvantiteten 100 från diagrammet."

#: include/global_settings.php:2472
msgid "Variance Number of Outliers"
msgstr "Varians Antal extremvärden"

#: include/global_settings.php:2473
msgid "This value represents the number of high and low average samples will be removed from the sample set prior to calculating the Variance Average.  If you choose an outlier value of 5, then both the top and bottom 5 averages are removed."
msgstr "Detta värde representerar det antal prover med högt och lågt medelvärde som tas bort från provuppsättningen innan variansmedelvärdet beräknas.  Om du väljer ett outlier-värde på 5 tas både de 5 högsta och de 5 lägsta medelvärdena bort."

#: include/global_settings.php:2477 include/global_settings.php:2478
#: include/global_settings.php:2479 include/global_settings.php:2480
#: include/global_settings.php:2481 include/global_settings.php:2482
#: include/global_settings.php:2483 include/global_settings.php:2484
#: include/global_settings.php:2485 include/global_settings.php:2486
#: include/global_settings.php:2487 include/global_settings.php:2488
#: include/global_settings.php:2489
#, php-format
msgid "%d High/Low Samples"
msgstr "%d Hög/Låg provtagning"

#: include/global_settings.php:2493
msgid "Max Kills Per RRA"
msgstr "Max antal dödade per RRA"

#: include/global_settings.php:2494
msgid "This value represents the maximum number of spikes to remove from a Graph RRA."
msgstr "Detta värde representerar det maximala antalet spikar som ska tas bort från en Graph RRA."

#: include/global_settings.php:2498 include/global_settings.php:2499
#: include/global_settings.php:2500 include/global_settings.php:2501
#: include/global_settings.php:2502 include/global_settings.php:2503
#: include/global_settings.php:2504 include/global_settings.php:2505
#: include/global_settings.php:2506 include/global_settings.php:2507
#: include/global_settings.php:2508 include/global_settings.php:2509
#, php-format
